  "answer_text": "You can log in to your Wells Fargo credit card account through the primary Wells Fargo Online portal. \n\n### How to Login:\n1. **Go to the Official Website:** Open your web browser and go directly to [wellsfargo.com](https://www.wellsfargo.com). *(Tip: Typing the web address directly into your browser's address bar is the safest way to avoid phishing sites).*\n2. **Locate the Sign-On Box:** On the left side of the home page (or by clicking \"Sign On\" on a mobile device), you will see the login area.\n3. **Enter Your Credentials:** Input your **Username** and **Password**.\n4. **Access Your Card:** Click the **Sign On** button. Once logged in, you will be able to view your credit card balance, see transactions, make payments, and manage your account.\n\n---\n\n### Alternative Ways to Access Your Account:\n* **The Wells Fargo Mobile\u00ae App:** Download the official app from the Apple App Store or Google Play Store. You can sign in using your existing online banking username and password, or set up biometric login (like Face ID or Touch ID) for quicker access.\n* **By Phone:** If you cannot access the internet, you can manage your credit card by calling the customer service number on the back of your card, or call Wells Fargo Customer Service directly.\n\n---\n\n### Need Help?\n* **Forgot your Username or Password?** Click the **\"Forgot Username or Password?\"** link located directly below the sign-on box on the homepage to reset your credentials.\n* **First-time user?** If you haven't set up online access yet, click **\"Enroll\"** or **\"Enroll Now\"** on the home page. You will need your credit card number, Social Security Number (SSN) or ITIN, and email address to set up your profile.",
